The Obsidian Pauldrons and Torso Tectonic Carapace
The upper body attire of this character is an extraordinary, form-fitting exhibition of natural, volcanic beast-armor and lightweight tribal fabrics designed for uninhibited, high-impact frontline combat. He wears an asymmetrical, high-collared vest jacket crafted from raw, textured leather dyed a dark charcoal-black, which leaves the right side of his deeply toned, muscular chest and abs completely exposed to reveal a network of glowing, golden elemental markings tracking along his muscle groups. Attached directly to his shoulders are two massive, rigid pauldrons sculpted from hardened obsidian stone shards that perfectly mimic the jagged, volcanic plating of a legendary beast. These dark stone structures flare upward and outward like defensive shields, with the left shoulder expanding into a sharp, multi-layered gauntlet assembly. His long, heavily muscled arms are partially bare to showcase his burning veins, but his wrists and forearms are encased in sleek, articulated bone-white bracers, with fingers that terminate in sharp, polished bronze talons capable of channeling high-temperature kinetic force.

The Tectonic Greaves and the Smoldering Lower Body
