In the early minutes of a Mobile Legends: Bang Bang match, the massive, armor-clad warriors of the Exp Lane—the sturdy tanks, lethal duelists, and unyielding fighters—converge upon the outer riverbank. They aren't just looking for a standard jungle skirmish; they are seeking a trial of wits and steel against Karkinos, The Scholar of the Emerald Shallows.

