The Instrument of History
The Petrified Coral Handle: The main shaft is forged from a singular, slender column of polished dark-purple deep-sea coral. It is wrapped tightly in thin bands of golden leather to guarantee an unbreakable grip against slippery sea spray, finishing in a weighted golden base hook.

