To prevent the total collapse of the local ecosystem, the primal river lords fused the raw kinetic energy of an oncoming tropical hurricane directly with the heart of the marshlands. The traditional Horned Lizard camp absorbed this cataclysmic upgrade, fracturing its old physical limits to evolve into Basilisk—a 178 cm tall, razor-jawed, bipedal demi-god. He now stands as the literal vanguard of the Litho Sanctuary, punishing anyone who treats his jungle marches like a simple resource farm.

🪓 The Weapon: The Dual-Pronged "Viper Tooth" Glaive
Basilisk does not engage in crude claw-to-claw brawling. He executes his tactical ambushes with a legendary, terrifyingly elegant polearm known as the Viper Tooth Glaive.

Measuring an imposing 210 cm in length, the weapon is built purely for high-velocity kinetic slashing. The main shaft is sculpted from a slender, perfectly balanced piece of blackened volcanic timber. To ensure his grip remains absolute even while maneuvering through slippery river marshes at supersonic speeds, the timber is wrapped tightly in thin bands of turquoise saurian leather, finishing in a weighted golden base hook that functions as a devastating blunt counterweight.

